{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/964e7b4cf206b38c9e2a6bb71f760946.avif?t=1774249634\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2014 Mesorift Survival \u2014</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mesorift Survival</strong> offers a classic survival experience with an exciting mix of PvP and PvE \u2013 set in a dangerous, tropical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast open-world map made up of three islands \u2013 one large main island and two smaller ones. You'll encounter dense jungle vegetation, abandoned bunker facilities, and old radio towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mesorift Survival</i> is launching in <strong>Early Access (version 0.0.1)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first public build lays the foundation\u2014content, balance, and performance will expand with frequent updates. Your feedback directly shapes development.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Survival Start</strong><br>You begin your journey on the beach \u2013 with nothing. Gather wood, stone, and other materials to craft your first tools like an axe and pickaxe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/b8b1bd2c634bf1187dcc5194593f443f.poster.avif?t=1774249634\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/b8b1bd2c634bf1187dcc5194593f443f.webm?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/b8b1bd2c634bf1187dcc5194593f443f.mp4?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dinosaurs</strong> <br>Due to a failed experiment, dinosaurs are now roaming the island \u2013 neither the bunker nor the radio tower facility was spared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/1e8e60effcdcfc4dac89140e4d62fbe8.poster.avif?t=1774249634\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/1e8e60effcdcfc4dac89140e4d62fbe8.webm?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/1e8e60effcdcfc4dac89140e4d62fbe8.mp4?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP and PvE Elements</strong><br>In addition to AI threats, other players can be just as deadly. Will you form alliances or trust no one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/55d5d32921d02557c2985e8d5daf438c.poster.avif?t=1774249634\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/55d5d32921d02557c2985e8d5daf438c.webm?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/55d5d32921d02557c2985e8d5daf438c.mp4?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resources &amp; Exploration</strong><br>Venture deeper into the wilderness to discover valuable resources like oil, silver, copper, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/b946383193490dbd9a96b1bd6c051176.poster.avif?t=1774249634\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/b946383193490dbd9a96b1bd6c051176.webm?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/b946383193490dbd9a96b1bd6c051176.mp4?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Building &amp; Crafting</strong><br>Construct and upgrade your own base. Craft useful tools and powerful weapons to defend yourself and dominate the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/508774961d8e5fb25ed6ac00227dedbf.poster.avif?t=1774249634\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/508774961d8e5fb25ed6ac00227dedbf.webm?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/508774961d8e5fb25ed6ac00227dedbf.mp4?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicles:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the islands faster with various vehicles. Use the trunk for additional storage space and safely transport valuable resources across the map. Mobility can provide the decisive advantage in both PvP and PvE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/9ee08759b266caedae48ae8b2e1ffe1c.poster.avif?t=1774249634\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/9ee08759b266caedae48ae8b2e1ffe1c.webm?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/9ee08759b266caedae48ae8b2e1ffe1c.mp4?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Own Dedicated Server</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Server Settings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player count, camera settings, max dino spawns, password, PvP or PvE mode, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/3a95a5be6bf4c00a715767b90abee3f3.poster.avif?t=1774249634\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/3a95a5be6bf4c00a715767b90abee3f3.webm?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/3a95a5be6bf4c00a715767b90abee3f3.mp4?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether solo or with friends \u2013 <i>Mesorift Survival</i> challenges you to survive, explore, and conquer in a brutal, untamed world.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Mesorift Survival","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3790650/5d386b719ba3b4ceb5a2fbdc67555aab4cbda652.jpg"},{"name":"Raptor Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3790650/93c3f33e56078503c63a1a9c442ce10b3d37199d.jpg"},{"name":"T-Rex Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3790650/19c3c37689659e8b5ae75c817492ba9549f1a34f.jpg"},{"name":"Brachiosaurus Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3790650/3186a2aec501091ccd0433faf51d571e0f0b25a6.jpg"},{"name":"Blood Moon Event 2025","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3790650/7af0217fb6a9eaed3a44f9e1e547e41d41b8b159.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790650?t=1774249634","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/bf9eedf87b627508b34c5e857865043175d6eabc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774249634","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/665bfec20298f73c1bd0007ce62e9a400d0d742d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774249634","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/665bfec20298f73c1bd0007ce62e9a400d0d742d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774249634","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/964e7b4cf206b38c9e2a6bb71f760946.avif?t=1774249634\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2014 Mesorift Survival \u2014</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mesorift Survival</strong> offers a classic survival experience with an exciting mix of PvP and PvE \u2013 set in a dangerous, tropical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast open-world map made up of three islands \u2013 one large main island and two smaller ones. You'll encounter dense jungle vegetation, abandoned bunker facilities, and old radio towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mesorift Survival</i> is launching in <strong>Early Access (version 0.0.1)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first public build lays the foundation\u2014content, balance, and performance will expand with frequent updates. Your feedback directly shapes development.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Survival Start</strong><br>You begin your journey on the beach \u2013 with nothing. Gather wood, stone, and other materials to craft your first tools like an axe and pickaxe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/b8b1bd2c634bf1187dcc5194593f443f.poster.avif?t=1774249634\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/b8b1bd2c634bf1187dcc5194593f443f.webm?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/b8b1bd2c634bf1187dcc5194593f443f.mp4?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dinosaurs</strong> <br>Due to a failed experiment, dinosaurs are now roaming the island \u2013 neither the bunker nor the radio tower facility was spared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/1e8e60effcdcfc4dac89140e4d62fbe8.poster.avif?t=1774249634\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/1e8e60effcdcfc4dac89140e4d62fbe8.webm?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/1e8e60effcdcfc4dac89140e4d62fbe8.mp4?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP and PvE Elements</strong><br>In addition to AI threats, other players can be just as deadly. Will you form alliances or trust no one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/55d5d32921d02557c2985e8d5daf438c.poster.avif?t=1774249634\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/55d5d32921d02557c2985e8d5daf438c.webm?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/55d5d32921d02557c2985e8d5daf438c.mp4?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resources &amp; Exploration</strong><br>Venture deeper into the wilderness to discover valuable resources like oil, silver, copper, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/b946383193490dbd9a96b1bd6c051176.poster.avif?t=1774249634\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/b946383193490dbd9a96b1bd6c051176.webm?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/b946383193490dbd9a96b1bd6c051176.mp4?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Building &amp; Crafting</strong><br>Construct and upgrade your own base. Craft useful tools and powerful weapons to defend yourself and dominate the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/508774961d8e5fb25ed6ac00227dedbf.poster.avif?t=1774249634\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/508774961d8e5fb25ed6ac00227dedbf.webm?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/508774961d8e5fb25ed6ac00227dedbf.mp4?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicles:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the islands faster with various vehicles. Use the trunk for additional storage space and safely transport valuable resources across the map. Mobility can provide the decisive advantage in both PvP and PvE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/9ee08759b266caedae48ae8b2e1ffe1c.poster.avif?t=1774249634\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/9ee08759b266caedae48ae8b2e1ffe1c.webm?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/9ee08759b266caedae48ae8b2e1ffe1c.mp4?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Own Dedicated Server</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Server Settings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player count, camera settings, max dino spawns, password, PvP or PvE mode, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/3a95a5be6bf4c00a715767b90abee3f3.poster.avif?t=1774249634\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/3a95a5be6bf4c00a715767b90abee3f3.webm?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/3a95a5be6bf4c00a715767b90abee3f3.mp4?t=1774249634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether solo or with friends \u2013 <i>Mesorift Survival</i> challenges you to survive, explore, and conquer in a brutal, untamed world.</p>","developers":["Meik.W Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/44c34a4b6fe1d8c8cd00e1df76712ffa735456d1/header.jpg?t=1774249634","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Meik.W Interactive. All rights reserved.  <br />\r\nThis product includes content created using the Unreal\u00ae Engine.  <br />\r\nUnreal\u00ae is a trademark or registered trademark of Epic Games, Inc. in the United States and elsewhere.  <br />\r\nSome 3D models and assets were licensed from the Unreal Engine Marketplace and are used in accordance with their respective licenses.  <br />\r\nAdditional models were purchased from CGTrader and used under their applicable licensing terms.  <br />\r\nThe game also contains original content created and owned entirely b